    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The most romantic piece this week is undoubtedly this new Rodeo bag, set against a backdrop of rose quartz suede lambskin, with delicate pink blossoms blooming across its surface. The entire bag is embroidered with tonal sequin petals and beaded flower centers, evoking a dreamy sea of flowers. The tender rose quartz hue is utterly enchanting, making it especially perfect for an upcoming Qixi Festival date.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
